{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/600x200.png?t=1747234805\" /><br><strong>Welcome to Fable Hospital!</strong> Enter a world of hospital management like you've never seen before. In this hilarious and satirical medieval simulation, you'll run your own hospital filled with eccentric characters, implausible diseases, and unique challenges.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Caracteristicas_del_Juego_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Gestion_Hospitalaria_Medieval_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>Manage your medieval hospital and ensure it runs like a well-oiled machine, or at least well enough for patients to survive\u2026 most of the time.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Gesti\u00f3n_Hospitalaria_Medieval.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Personajes_Inolvidables_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>Recruit and manage a cast of colorful characters, from the sinister Plague Doctor to the absent-minded Mad Engineer. Each employee has their own set of skills and... quirks.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Peronajes_inolvidables.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Enfermedades_Hilarantes_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>Treat patients with diseases that defy all logic, from &quot;Lycanthropy&quot; to &quot;Unicorn Syndrome.&quot; Each diagnosis is more absurd than the last!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Enfermedades_Hilarantes.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Recursos_Agricultura_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>Step outside the hospital and venture into the countryside to gather herbs, minerals, and other essential resources. Your hospital won't stock itself!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Recursos_y_Agricultura.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Investigacion_y_Desarrollo_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>Use alchemy and magic to research new cures and technologies. Unlock upgrades that make your hospital more efficient and hopefully less prone to fires.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Investigaci\u00f3n_y_Desarrollo.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Humor_y_Satira_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>Enjoy dialogues and situations filled with satirical humor. From employees who prefer to have a beer instead of working, to nuns who secretly adore parties, every moment is full of laughs.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Humor_y_S\u00e1tira.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Estilo_Artistico_Encantador_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>With detailed graphics and an art style that captures the essence of the medieval era, Fable Hospital is a visual delight that complements its clever gameplay.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Estilo_Artistico_Encantador.gif?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Sumergete_en_el_Caos_Medieval_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" /><br>In Fable Hospital, each day brings new challenges and surprises. Can you manage the chaos of a medieval hospital and keep your patients alive? Or will you find yourself caught in a sea of laughs and disasters?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Icono_Calavera.png?t=1747234805\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/Elabora_Ingl\u00e9s_.png?t=1747234805\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2726060?t=1747234805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/d44a1aea283459de400dbc4143590cd4e901179c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747234805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747234805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747234805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726060/extras/600x200.png?t=1747234805\" /><br><strong>Welcome to Fable Hospital!</strong> Enter a world of hospital management like you've never seen before. In this hilarious and satirical medieval simulation, you'll run your own hospital filled with eccentric characters, implausible diseases, and unique 